WEBVTT

00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:39.400
Old Tong, I really didn't see it coming.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.480
You're quite the operator.

00:01:43.159 --> 00:01:45.000
You got Director Qiu on your side.

00:01:45.159 --> 00:01:46.879
And you've got a big shot backing you.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.959
A true master stays hidden.

00:01:49.319 --> 00:01:50.719
Manager Liu, I really don't.

00:01:50.719 --> 00:01:51.920
I know.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.599
You and Xiao Jia have never quite gotten along.

00:01:55.159 --> 00:01:56.680
I've already made arrangements for you.

00:01:56.719 --> 00:01:58.319
No, no, I really don't mean anything by it.

00:01:58.319 --> 00:01:59.760
I get it, I get it.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.760
It has nothing to do with you, don't worry.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.079
I really don't mean that.

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.280
Given that Comrade Jia Zhilong

00:02:14.479 --> 00:02:16.039
has had poor performance recently,

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:17.639
it has been decided after discussion

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.439
to adjust his position.

00:02:19.879 --> 00:02:21.039
Comrade Tong Qiu,

00:02:21.319 --> 00:02:23.280
has shown outstanding performance and a serious attitude.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.759
After collective deliberation by management,

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:28.039
it is proposed to appoint him as Assistant Branch Manager.

00:02:28.719 --> 00:02:30.280
This has been reported to the relevant authorities.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.360
Good. Meeting adjourned.

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:38.120
Well, well.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:38.599
Congratulations.

00:02:38.599 --> 00:02:39.719
Congratulations!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.960
You went straight for the big move.

00:02:41.960 --> 00:02:42.280
Old Tong.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:44.639
I always said you'd make something of yourself.

00:02:44.639 --> 00:02:45.000
Brother Tong.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:45.479
I told you so.

00:02:45.479 --> 00:02:46.759
Our Brother Tong was bound to get promoted.

00:02:46.759 --> 00:02:47.360
Exactly.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.120
You're treating us to a meal!

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:48.759
You're buying dinner!

00:02:48.759 --> 00:02:50.240
You absolutely have to treat us tonight!

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:59.479
No, no, no, Manager Jia.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.439
Why are you so upset?

00:03:02.439 --> 00:03:03.960
Alright, alright, just ignore him.

00:03:04.479 --> 00:03:05.719
Where are we eating tonight?

00:03:05.719 --> 00:03:06.639
Barbecue.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.280
No, it's not that.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.800
This is just the leadership showing me favor.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.280
The leaders appreciate me.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:11.960
What are you being modest for?

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.280
I'm not being modest, not at all.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.080
Not being low-key either.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:15.840
Okay, okay.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.319
We'll... we'll do it later, later.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.000
I'll treat everyone later, I promise.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:20.879
No, no, we're treating you.

00:03:20.879 --> 00:03:22.479
No, no, no, it's on me, on me.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.520
I'm heading out first.

00:03:24.599 --> 00:03:25.800
How come he's all flustered

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.439
after getting a promotion?

00:03:27.439 --> 00:03:27.800
Let's go.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:29.039
He's just dizzy with excitement.

00:03:29.039 --> 00:03:29.520
Let's go, let's go.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:30.840
We're out of here too, let's go.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.520
Let's go.

00:03:36.599 --> 00:03:37.520
Honey.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.560
Listen to this.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.879
Something huge happened to me today.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.919
Don't rush, don't rush. Take your time.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.599
Just now.

00:03:50.759 --> 00:03:51.759
Just now.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.800
I'm getting promoted. Assistant Branch Manager.

00:03:55.879 --> 00:03:57.199
You scared me.

00:03:57.199 --> 00:03:59.120
I thought something bad happened to you.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.120
No, no, no.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:00.840
It's just that I feel...

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.120
The more I think about it, the more nervous I get.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.319
What are you nervous about?

00:04:04.879 --> 00:04:06.560
You've been hoping for this for so long.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.120
Don't you worry.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.360
You earned this all by yourself.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.000
No, no, no, that's not it.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.039
Look.

00:04:12.039 --> 00:04:13.759
I finally figured it out now.

00:04:13.879 --> 00:04:15.560
If I just rise up like this,

00:04:15.599 --> 00:04:17.639
how many eyes will be watching me?

00:04:17.639 --> 00:04:19.279
Take Xiao Jia, for example.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.879
He was originally the Assistant Branch Manager.

00:04:20.879 --> 00:04:22.920
By convention, after a full year he'd be promoted to Vice President.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.120
Now that I'm going up, he's going down.

00:04:25.279 --> 00:04:27.639
You have no idea how he was glaring at me.

00:04:27.639 --> 00:04:28.920
Alright, alright.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.600
Don't overthink it.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.959
If you're afraid of this and afraid of that,

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.680
you might as well not go to work at all.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.000
Husband, you do your job well.

00:04:39.519 --> 00:04:40.839
No one's going to do anything to you.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.360
Trust me, okay?

00:04:43.399 --> 00:04:46.319
Right? Yeah, you're right.

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:49.120
Well, then we'll just take it one step at a time.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:49.800
Right?

00:04:51.079 --> 00:04:52.800
Okay, I'll get back to work then.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:54.959
Bye, sweetie.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.120
Love you.

00:05:04.079 --> 00:05:04.800
Yeah.

00:05:06.519 --> 00:05:07.279
Yeah.

00:05:13.839 --> 00:05:15.000
Time to get off work.

00:05:30.199 --> 00:05:31.600
He really got promoted.

00:05:32.199 --> 00:05:33.000
Promoted.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:38.000
You're not lying to us this time, are you?

00:05:38.079 --> 00:05:39.519
I'm really not lying to you.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.600
Great! That's great!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.439
Good son. You've made something of yourself.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.639
So, with this promotion...

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.519
...your salary should go up a bit, right?

00:05:47.519 --> 00:05:47.839
Yeah.

00:05:47.839 --> 00:05:50.199
The salary will increase. It definitely will.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.079
If the salary goes up...

00:05:53.079 --> 00:05:54.439
...the financial pressure won't be so heavy.

00:05:54.439 --> 00:05:55.199
Then Xiaoshi...

00:05:55.199 --> 00:05:56.800
...can be transferred back sooner, right?

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.360
About whether she can come back or not...

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.879
I... I'll wait until I'm officially in the position,

00:06:00.879 --> 00:06:02.079
then I'll discuss it properly with her.

00:06:02.079 --> 00:06:03.360
Don't worry about that for now.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.439
Don't be in such a rush about this.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.600
A promotion has its advantages,

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:10.920
but it also comes with pressure.

00:06:11.199 --> 00:06:14.120
You just focus on doing a good job at work.

00:06:14.439 --> 00:06:15.920
From now on,

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:18.360
our family's life will just get better and better.

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.199
Right?

00:06:19.199 --> 00:06:19.560
Yes, Dad.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.199
Let me tell you,

00:06:20.199 --> 00:06:21.519
our family's good days are just beginning.

00:06:21.519 --> 00:06:21.920
As for you...

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.519
...really, don't put so much pressure on yourself.

00:06:23.519 --> 00:06:24.879
Take your time with that script.

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:25.360
Okay?

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:25.839
Okay, okay, okay.

00:06:25.839 --> 00:06:26.920
Alright, I'll take it easy. I'll take it easy.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.319
Right, right, right.

00:06:28.319 --> 00:06:29.199
Qiu'er!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:30.800
You got promoted!

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:31.360
Chunsheng.

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.199
Promoted, promoted, promoted!

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:34.759
Uncle, Auntie.

00:06:34.759 --> 00:06:36.040
Then we have to celebrate!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.439
Come to my place for some good food. Let's go.

00:06:37.439 --> 00:06:38.600
Let's all go together.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.879
No, no. You boys go ahead first.

00:06:40.879 --> 00:06:42.800
I still have some lines to work on.

00:06:43.079 --> 00:06:43.839
You go on ahead.

00:06:43.839 --> 00:06:45.759
Alright then, we won't stand on ceremony with you two.

00:06:45.759 --> 00:06:46.439
Let's go, let's go, Qiu'er.

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:47.560
Let's go.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:49.519
Sorry about that.

00:06:49.519 --> 00:06:50.639
What good food do you want to eat?

00:06:50.639 --> 00:06:51.959
Hairy crabs!

00:06:53.439 --> 00:06:55.079
This is perfect now.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.199
Delicious.

00:06:57.399 --> 00:06:58.639
Let me propose a toast to everyone.

00:06:58.639 --> 00:07:01.199
Special thanks to all the leaders for attending my...

00:07:01.199 --> 00:07:02.360
...humble promotion celebration.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:03.879
This promotion banquet, right?

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.920
Special thanks to Brother Wang, Brother Wang...

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.839
No, Director Ma!

00:07:08.839 --> 00:07:10.079
Director Ma!

00:07:10.079 --> 00:07:11.879
Brother Ma, Brother Ma, my apologies, apologies.

00:07:12.439 --> 00:07:13.519
Pleasure, pleasure.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.560
Li, Li, Li... Sis Li, Li... Sis Li!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.160
Long live Sis Li! Sis Li!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.319
Coming, coming!

00:07:18.319 --> 00:07:19.600
Pleasure, pleasure.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:20.800
He's happy today.

00:07:20.839 --> 00:07:21.600
I'm telling you, don't...

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:24.079
Don't drink it all. Don't drink anymore.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:26.759
Here, have some fruit.

00:07:26.759 --> 00:07:27.439
Come on, come on.

00:07:27.439 --> 00:07:28.920
Hurry, hurry, hurry up.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.519
Eat some fruit.

00:07:30.519 --> 00:07:31.199
Eat fruit.

00:07:31.439 --> 00:07:32.800
How did he get this drunk?

00:07:32.839 --> 00:07:33.759
A toast just for you. Just for you.

00:07:33.759 --> 00:07:34.079
Come on, come on.

00:07:34.079 --> 00:07:35.920
Isn't he just happy about the promotion?

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.040
You, hurry up.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:37.800
Here, you take charge.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:38.360
He can't drink anymore.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.519
Yes, I know, I know, I know.

00:07:39.519 --> 00:07:41.199
Come on, come on. Let me toast everyone.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.160
Sis.

00:07:42.199 --> 00:07:43.519
Okay, thank you, Sis.

00:07:43.519 --> 00:07:44.519
Thank you all.

00:07:44.519 --> 00:07:44.920
Thanks.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:46.079
Enjoy the food and drinks.

00:07:46.079 --> 00:07:47.800
Please offer your valuable suggestions in the future.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:48.639
Right, more valuable suggestions.

00:07:48.639 --> 00:07:49.560
You're too kind.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.399
I'll finish mine. Everyone, drink at your own pace.

00:07:51.399 --> 00:07:51.759
Okay.

00:07:51.759 --> 00:07:52.120
Alright.

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:52.759
Thank you.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.120
Alright.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.560
Come on, come on, let's dig in.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:58.399
Eat, eat, eat some fruit.

00:07:58.399 --> 00:07:59.759
Have some fruit. Have some fruit.

00:07:59.759 --> 00:08:00.800
Have some dishes.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:03.000
Should I go get some water?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:03.920
Go get some, go get some.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.000
Go get some water.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.160
What's wrong?

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.759
You're really something, you know that?

00:08:28.319 --> 00:08:30.399
You were the one who told me not to meddle before.

00:08:30.399 --> 00:08:31.839
You were the one who left without a word.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.360
And now you're back, making a complete mess of things.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.519
What exactly do you want?

00:08:37.639 --> 00:08:40.159
You're still angry about the cafe thing?

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:41.919
You've misunderstood.

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.000
Feifei was worried you'd be tricked,

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.120
so she asked me to check out...

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:47.519
...that guy's character, that's all.

00:08:49.159 --> 00:08:50.159
Everyone in this whole alley...

00:08:50.159 --> 00:08:51.879
...combined doesn't have as many schemes as you do.

00:08:53.159 --> 00:08:54.320
Let me say this one more time.

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:55.120
Matters of the heart...

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:56.519
...if anyone's to meddle, it's not your turn.

00:08:56.519 --> 00:08:57.639
That's my uncle's job.

00:08:57.919 --> 00:08:59.759
And work matters are even less your business.

00:09:00.159 --> 00:09:01.559
You pulling Wang Fei into this...

00:09:01.559 --> 00:09:03.000
...I can let that slide.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.159
You fooled everyone with a fake medical report...

00:09:05.519 --> 00:09:06.840
...and I don't want to expose you either.

00:09:07.759 --> 00:09:08.120
In short,

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.039
from now on, let's just leave each other alone, okay?

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:14.159
You knew all along.

00:09:19.639 --> 00:09:20.840
After all that trouble...

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:24.200
...you came back just to hold the exhibition and fulfill your wish, right?

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.399
Why can he help you...

00:09:25.399 --> 00:09:26.399
...but I can't?

00:09:27.399 --> 00:09:28.559
He helps me, I help him.

00:09:28.559 --> 00:09:29.840
We're friends helping each other.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.000
And you? Why do you want to help me?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:32.759
Isn't it clear in your heart?

00:09:32.759 --> 00:09:33.240
I...

00:09:33.639 --> 00:09:34.799
You... you what?

00:09:36.639 --> 00:09:38.000
We're friends too, aren't we?

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:40.840
I've said it before.

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:42.000
You don't owe me anything.

00:09:49.639 --> 00:09:52.360
You know my situation very well.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.639
It's not that I don't want to do many things.

00:09:55.399 --> 00:09:56.480
It's that I can't.

00:09:58.159 --> 00:09:59.279
That so-called kind of...

00:10:00.399 --> 00:10:01.200
promise.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.120
Given my condition, I can't make one.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.639
Don't you get it yet?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:07.759
Yes, I confessed my feelings to you before.

00:10:07.759 --> 00:10:09.120
But when I said I liked you,

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:10.559
I wasn't asking for anything in return.

00:10:10.559 --> 00:10:12.399
Because I thought you felt the same way I did.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.120
I thought if I said it out loud,

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.120
you'd stop running away.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.159
You'd pull yourself together a bit.

00:10:16.159 --> 00:10:18.480
You'd find the courage to fight your illness.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.919
But I guess I was wrong.

00:10:21.639 --> 00:10:24.000
Because you're a complete coward.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.320
You don't have the courage to face your own feelings.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.639
Or the courage to face your own condition.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:32.759
I've thought about it too.

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.440
I think someone like you...

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.559
isn't worth my affection.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.000
If you interfere in my life again,

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.879
I'll move out of the hutong immediately.

00:10:50.159 --> 00:10:51.000
You can leave now.

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:51.879
Wang Chunsheng.

00:11:51.879 --> 00:11:53.159
What have you been doing all this time?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.159
What's this about?

00:11:57.159 --> 00:11:59.320
Got a date today? All dolled up.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:02.639
No.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.159
Isn't Teacher Xia Tian coming to collaborate?

00:12:05.279 --> 00:12:07.039
I gotta spruce myself up a bit.

00:12:07.519 --> 00:12:08.919
Hold on, hold on, hold on.

00:12:08.919 --> 00:12:10.080
What?

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.639
Hey, all these years we've known each other,

00:12:12.639 --> 00:12:15.080
I've never seen you spruce up for me.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:15.559
Here.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:18.279
For us...

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:20.279
Aren't you just wasting your time?

00:12:20.279 --> 00:12:21.960
How am I wasting your time?

00:12:25.759 --> 00:12:26.639
Let me tell you something.

00:12:26.639 --> 00:12:27.480
If you've got nothing better to do,

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.080
you should watch more of...

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:30.639
Teacher Xia Tian's live streams.

00:12:31.159 --> 00:12:32.399
Look how dark you are.

00:12:32.399 --> 00:12:34.240
You should whiten your skin when you can.

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:36.639
Here.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.679
You've got that pretty-boy vibe today.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.080
Hey, what are you doing?

00:12:44.679 --> 00:12:45.600
This is ridiculous.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:46.960
You're putting it on me?

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.559
Isn't this thing too wet to use?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:04.759
You're being ridiculous, you know that?

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.720
It does feel pretty good.

00:13:18.799 --> 00:13:22.159
How long do I leave this thing on?

00:13:23.039 --> 00:13:24.639
Take it off when it's dry.

00:13:26.799 --> 00:13:29.120
Should've wrung it out more then.

00:13:44.039 --> 00:13:44.559
Xia...

00:13:46.879 --> 00:13:49.200
Teacher Xia Tian, you drove yourself?

00:13:49.679 --> 00:13:52.240
Master Wang, is it okay to park my car here?

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:54.360
No problem. If it's in the way later, I'll move it for you.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.759
First of all, thank you for gracing our humble establishment.

00:13:59.759 --> 00:14:01.840
It truly brings honor to my humble abode.

00:14:01.879 --> 00:14:03.240
You're too kind.

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.519
This is my first time venturing into the food industry.

00:14:05.519 --> 00:14:06.360
You're the expert here.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.360
No, no, no.

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:08.399
I don't deserve that title.

00:14:08.399 --> 00:14:09.559
I should be learning from you.

00:14:09.559 --> 00:14:10.399
Please, come inside.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.320
So this is the century-old plaque you mentioned.

00:14:13.679 --> 00:14:16.519
Yes, that's from my grandfather...

00:14:16.519 --> 00:14:18.399
passed down from his grandfather's generation.

00:14:18.759 --> 00:14:21.559
You could say it's weathered many storms, seen it all.

00:14:21.559 --> 00:14:22.720
Please, let's go inside, inside.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.159
Come on, come, come, come.

00:14:25.799 --> 00:14:27.320
Watch your step, here.

00:14:30.519 --> 00:14:31.759
Our little shop here...

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.720
Although it's faced its share of troubles,

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:37.559
it's still kept the old flavors alive.

00:14:37.559 --> 00:14:39.879
You could say it's a kind of legacy.

00:14:40.159 --> 00:14:41.159
Then I must have a taste.

00:14:41.159 --> 00:14:42.559
You absolutely must try it.

00:14:42.559 --> 00:14:43.679
Here, please have a seat.

00:14:44.159 --> 00:14:45.159
You're back.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.080
This is my wife.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:48.559
Quick, go get Teacher Xia some water.

00:14:48.559 --> 00:14:49.240
Hurry, hurry!

00:14:49.679 --> 00:14:51.039
Please, sit, sit, sit.

00:14:52.159 --> 00:14:53.879
Well, this craft of mine...

00:14:53.879 --> 00:14:55.360
I learned it from my grandfather.

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.159
You could say...

00:14:56.159 --> 00:14:57.559
I've spent half my life...

00:14:57.559 --> 00:14:58.679
right here in this shop.

00:14:58.679 --> 00:14:59.360
Here's some water.

00:14:59.360 --> 00:15:00.200
Thank you, sister-in-law.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.679
Hey, why are you bringing plain water?

00:15:01.679 --> 00:15:03.240
Go get my good tea.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.279
No need, no need, this is just fine.

00:15:05.279 --> 00:15:07.240
No, no, absolutely not. Go get the good tea, go!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.200
Don't trouble yourself, sister-in-law.

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:08.879
It's no trouble at all.

00:15:08.879 --> 00:15:09.399
Here it is.

00:15:09.399 --> 00:15:11.519
So this is the situation on the first floor.

00:15:11.639 --> 00:15:12.960
Let me take you upstairs to have a look.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.840
The view up there is something special.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.879
Once you go up and take a look,

00:15:16.879 --> 00:15:19.360
you can see all of Beijing from up there.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.000
It really is.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.639
And it's a great spot for filming, you know?

00:15:21.639 --> 00:15:21.879
You know what I mean?

00:15:21.879 --> 00:15:22.559
Right, come on, come on.

00:15:22.559 --> 00:15:23.559
This way, please, this way.

00:15:23.559 --> 00:15:25.759
You go get the tea, hurry up, quick!

00:15:25.759 --> 00:15:27.240
Come on, come on, this way please.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.639
Be careful now.

00:16:11.559 --> 00:16:14.000
Yes, I confessed my feelings to you before.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.360
But when I said I liked you,

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:16.720
I wasn't asking for anything in return.

00:16:16.759 --> 00:16:18.639
Because I thought you felt the same way I did.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.279
I thought if I said it out loud,

00:16:20.279 --> 00:16:21.279
you'd stop running away.

00:16:21.279 --> 00:16:22.360
You'd pull yourself together a bit.

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:24.639
You'd find the courage to fight your illness.

00:16:25.559 --> 00:16:27.159
But I guess I was wrong.

00:16:27.879 --> 00:16:30.159
Because you're a complete coward.

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:33.519
You don't have the courage to face your own feelings.

00:16:33.519 --> 00:16:35.799
Or the courage to face your own condition.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:37.039
I think someone like you...

00:16:37.039 --> 00:16:38.240
isn't worth my affection.

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:20.039
Martin.

00:17:20.279 --> 00:17:21.640
In your brainstem,

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.359
a glioma lesion has been discovered.

00:17:25.279 --> 00:17:28.200
Surgery is recommended immediately.

00:17:28.559 --> 00:17:31.000
If the nerves can be spared

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.200
and the lesion successfully removed,

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:37.200
then you can live a normal life.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:39.119
Just like before.

00:17:49.119 --> 00:17:49.880
I'm here.

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.920
I made you some more soup.

00:18:00.559 --> 00:18:01.440
Thank you, big brother.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:04.119
How have you been these past couple days?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.920
Pretty good, see?

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:07.839
That's good to hear.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:09.839
I just finished up my work,

00:18:09.839 --> 00:18:11.279
so I said I'd hurry over to see you.

00:18:11.599 --> 00:18:12.440
It's fine.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.279
Been in touch these past couple days.

00:18:14.279 --> 00:18:15.880
How's it going over there?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.240
When can the treatment start?

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.039
Big bro, don't worry.

00:18:19.039 --> 00:18:20.160
There's a waiting list.

00:18:21.759 --> 00:18:23.759
Don't you fret, I've got it all arranged.

00:18:25.279 --> 00:18:27.440
So now we just have to wait?

00:18:27.799 --> 00:18:28.880
For... for now, yes.

00:18:31.559 --> 00:18:34.720
No, if that's the case, let's just go there first.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.759
Let's go over there and wait.

00:18:36.759 --> 00:18:38.519
It's a queue, right?

00:18:38.519 --> 00:18:39.759
What if, in the meantime...

00:18:39.759 --> 00:18:41.440
A few people don't show up, you know?

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:42.680
Then we'd be first in line.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.559
What do you think?

00:18:43.759 --> 00:18:44.519
Big bro...

00:18:44.759 --> 00:18:45.480
Wasn't it you guys...

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.839
who dragged me back from abroad?

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:49.119
Back then...

00:18:49.119 --> 00:18:51.119
Didn't you think I was all alone out there...

00:18:51.119 --> 00:18:53.359
What if I got a bit depressed...

00:18:53.359 --> 00:18:55.119
and did something, you know?

00:18:55.359 --> 00:18:57.240
Now you know it can be treated.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.160
So let's just go quickly, what do you say?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.240
Big bro, there's no rush.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.519
Besides...

00:19:02.519 --> 00:19:03.519
All that back-and-forth travel...

00:19:03.519 --> 00:19:05.519
isn't good for my condition either, right?

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:06.960
No, no.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:08.240
You're doing pretty well now, aren't you?

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.319
Whether we go through the hassle early or late...

00:19:09.319 --> 00:19:11.240
don't we have to make that trip anyway?

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:13.519
Teacher Xiatian came, didn't she?

00:19:13.519 --> 00:19:14.759
How did your talk go?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.680
Let me tell you about Teacher Xiatian...

00:19:17.039 --> 00:19:19.519
She's extremely satisfied with us.

00:19:19.519 --> 00:19:20.440
She told me...

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.400
she wants me to do livestreams with her.

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.759
I saw Lianbao and Qianqian...

00:19:26.759 --> 00:19:28.160
are also coordinating very smoothly.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:28.759
Right.

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:31.039
Once everything here is on track...

00:19:31.039 --> 00:19:33.319
I'll go back and focus on treatment, okay?

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:36.039
With that promise from you...

00:19:36.039 --> 00:19:37.160
it's a deal.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.039
You can't fool me again, Weiguo.

00:19:39.039 --> 00:19:40.440
How could I fool you?

00:19:40.799 --> 00:19:41.599
Good.

00:19:41.880 --> 00:19:42.400
Come on, come on.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.240
Drink the soup while it's hot, come on.

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.680
It'll get cold in a bit.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.400
I adjusted the flavor for you again this time.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:50.119
Try it.

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.799
Thanks, big bro. I'm just getting hungry.

00:19:52.799 --> 00:19:54.079
No need for thanks. Try it.

00:19:54.079 --> 00:19:54.640
Okay.

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.240
How is it? A bit more palatable?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.000
Seems about the same.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.200
This, this, this...

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.200
Then I'll adjust it for you again next time.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.440
I refuse to believe it.

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.720
It's fine, it's okay.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:21.880
Jing'er.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.119
A gift for you.

00:20:25.119 --> 00:20:26.559
From France.

00:20:26.559 --> 00:20:28.680
High-end skincare. Very expensive.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:34.160
This... this must be really pricey.

00:20:35.799 --> 00:20:37.119
Listen, Chunsheng...

00:20:37.119 --> 00:20:37.839
From now on...

00:20:37.839 --> 00:20:40.119
you really shouldn't waste money like this.

00:20:40.119 --> 00:20:42.519
Buying useless things for me.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.119
No, this didn't cost any money.

00:20:45.279 --> 00:20:46.680
Teacher Xiatian gave it.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.000
Just do as she says.

00:20:48.119 --> 00:20:49.759
Use it consistently for three months.

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:50.640
By then...

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.640
your skin will be as good as Teacher Xiatian's.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.960
I'm fine the way I am now.

00:20:56.599 --> 00:20:58.240
No, in the future...

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.359
we'll have a long-term partnership with Teacher Xiatian.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.720
Then I can give you lots of things.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.279
She has tons of good stuff.

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:09.680
Dad, you finally wised up.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.880
Knowing to give Mom such nice skincare.

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.400
Teacher Xiatian gave it.

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.680
Now, one word from Teacher Xiatian...

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.640
is worth ten thousand from your mom.

00:21:19.119 --> 00:21:19.960
Feifei.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.160
Later, I'll be doing livestreams...

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:23.559
with Teacher Xiatian.

00:21:23.799 --> 00:21:25.240
I need to fix up my look.

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:26.839
Come here, come here. Help me choose.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:28.640
I picked out a few. Take a look.

00:21:29.279 --> 00:21:30.759
Mom, Mom.

00:21:31.519 --> 00:21:32.400
Where are you going?

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:33.400
Something at the shop.

00:21:33.839 --> 00:21:34.960
Come back early.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.400
Is the window not closed or something?

00:21:38.799 --> 00:21:39.920
Such a loud noise.

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:42.119
Let me see.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.680
No, what was that sound just now?

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.480
The window wasn't closed?

00:21:48.920 --> 00:21:49.720
Right?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:22.880
Isn't the opening today?

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:24.759
And brought a huge wave of traffic for my dad.

00:22:24.759 --> 00:22:26.359
Look at all these, one after another.

00:22:26.359 --> 00:22:28.039
Well, then post more.

00:22:28.039 --> 00:22:29.680
Later, people will come swarming...

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:30.720
all looking for your dad, right?

00:22:30.720 --> 00:22:31.720
Listen to your mom.

00:22:31.720 --> 00:22:33.000
You're so out of touch.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.200
You're clueless, Mom.

00:22:34.359 --> 00:22:35.920
Posting videos, it's...

00:22:35.920 --> 00:22:37.599
Don't explain to your mom, she won't get it.

00:22:37.599 --> 00:22:38.400
Let's you and I discuss it.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:39.359
No, son.

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:40.759
You, explain it to Mom.

00:22:40.759 --> 00:22:42.039
Mom wants to learn too, right? I, I...

00:22:42.039 --> 00:22:42.400
I'm telling you...

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:44.559
Can't you do something within your capabilities?

00:22:44.559 --> 00:22:45.759
Go cook noodles.

00:23:21.119 --> 00:23:21.799
Weiguo

00:23:21.799 --> 00:23:22.559
Sis

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:24.680
Why are you back again?

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:30.200
I... I thought there was something at Penglexuan.

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:31.759
But once I got here, I thought...

00:23:31.759 --> 00:23:33.000
It can wait till tomorrow.

00:23:35.759 --> 00:23:37.000
I'll head back first.

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.559
Let me keep you company for a bit.

00:23:40.759 --> 00:23:41.519
Alright.

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:42.880
Okay, come on, have a seat.

00:23:45.559 --> 00:23:46.759
How have you been lately?

00:23:47.279 --> 00:23:48.039
Are you okay?

00:23:52.519 --> 00:23:54.240
I just wanted to get out for a walk.

00:23:54.559 --> 00:23:56.640
And then, as I walked...

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:57.519
I don't know how...

00:23:57.519 --> 00:23:59.000
I ended up at Penglexuan again.

00:24:01.319 --> 00:24:03.519
Just now, standing at the door, I was thinking...

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:06.559
My day-to-day life...

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.880
It's just home and the restaurant.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:11.880
I don't even have an "off-duty" time.

00:24:14.559 --> 00:24:15.799
Lately...

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:17.680
Big Brother's been busy with the Duck King competition,

00:24:17.759 --> 00:24:18.880
busy opening the new shop,

00:24:19.400 --> 00:24:21.400
and collaborating with that Teacher Xiatian.

00:24:22.319 --> 00:24:23.960
He hasn't been paying much attention to you, has he?

00:24:26.680 --> 00:24:28.519
It's been over an hour since I left.

00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:31.319
Not even a single message.

00:24:33.759 --> 00:24:34.799
Honestly, Sis...

00:24:35.519 --> 00:24:36.200
Do you think...

00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:37.880
Big Brother and that Teacher Xiatian...

00:24:38.200 --> 00:24:39.440
No, not at all.

00:24:39.960 --> 00:24:40.559
Really, no.

00:24:40.559 --> 00:24:41.440
Really, no.

00:24:41.759 --> 00:24:43.559
I know your Big Brother.

00:24:47.720 --> 00:24:49.000
Actually, your Big Brother...

00:24:49.759 --> 00:24:50.960
He's got no real faults.

00:24:52.319 --> 00:24:54.319
First, no bad habits.

00:24:55.000 --> 00:24:56.000
Second...

00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:59.160
He's not the type to fool around outside.

00:25:00.640 --> 00:25:02.720
And he's a fantastic cook.

00:25:05.000 --> 00:25:07.519
I don't know how it is where you're from,

00:25:07.759 --> 00:25:10.839
but around here, a man like your Big Brother...

00:25:11.319 --> 00:25:14.319
is absolutely top-notch.

00:25:14.440 --> 00:25:16.319
One in a hundred, a great guy.

00:25:19.519 --> 00:25:20.519
I think...

00:25:22.200 --> 00:25:24.000
You two should really have a good talk.

00:25:24.680 --> 00:25:26.599
Haven't you been lacking communication lately?

00:25:28.119 --> 00:25:29.000
Weiguo...

00:25:29.319 --> 00:25:32.759
What do you mean by "more communication"?

00:25:33.079 --> 00:25:35.240
Take me and your Big Brother, for example.

00:25:35.799 --> 00:25:37.200
We either talk about Feifei,

00:25:37.799 --> 00:25:40.799
or we talk about Penglexuan stuff.

00:25:41.319 --> 00:25:44.200
There's nothing else to talk about.

00:25:45.519 --> 00:25:46.759
Especially recently...

00:25:47.119 --> 00:25:49.759
He and Feifei are working on that...

00:25:49.880 --> 00:25:50.680
That thing of his...

00:25:50.680 --> 00:25:52.119
That... that account.

00:25:52.359 --> 00:25:53.119
I know.

00:25:55.400 --> 00:25:57.160
When they talk about it...

00:25:57.680 --> 00:25:59.559
I... I really can't understand it.

00:26:00.799 --> 00:26:01.799
And second...

00:26:01.799 --> 00:26:03.200
When I try to join in...

00:26:03.519 --> 00:26:05.000
I really can't get a word in.

00:26:06.759 --> 00:26:08.119
We're not like...

00:26:08.759 --> 00:26:10.000
Teacher Xiatian, right?

00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:11.000
She's...

00:26:11.000 --> 00:26:12.759
In the end, it's still about that Teacher Xiatian, isn't it?

00:26:12.759 --> 00:26:15.200
It's really not, nothing like that.

00:26:17.559 --> 00:26:18.759
How about this, Sis.

00:26:20.319 --> 00:26:22.200
I have an idea for you. Will you listen?

00:26:22.319 --> 00:26:23.400
What idea?

00:26:23.960 --> 00:26:26.640
You should go stay at your parents' place for a few days.

00:26:26.759 --> 00:26:28.119
Put aside things at home and the restaurant.

00:26:28.119 --> 00:26:29.079
Just let them be for now.

00:26:29.319 --> 00:26:31.720
No, no, both places need someone.

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:32.920
Didn't you say...

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:35.039
you never get a break all year?

00:26:35.240 --> 00:26:35.839
This time...

00:26:35.839 --> 00:26:38.119
just treat it as giving yourself a big vacation, okay?

00:26:40.759 --> 00:26:41.880
That wouldn't work, would it?

00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:44.000
What if something happens?

00:26:44.000 --> 00:26:45.039
Just give it a try.

00:26:46.000 --> 00:26:47.119
Nothing will happen.

00:26:49.400 --> 00:26:50.480
What could possibly happen?

00:26:52.920 --> 00:26:53.599
Alright.

00:26:56.480 --> 00:26:57.000
A big vacation.

00:26:57.000 --> 00:26:57.519
Okay.

00:26:57.839 --> 00:26:59.839
Relax, just rel...

00:27:24.240 --> 00:27:26.400
Jing'er, get me a pair of socks.

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:33.119
Jing'er, get me a clean pair of socks.

00:27:39.519 --> 00:27:40.279
Jing'er?

00:27:43.400 --> 00:27:44.160
Jing'er?

00:27:46.519 --> 00:27:47.480
Where's your mom?

00:28:04.039 --> 00:28:05.160
Get me a bowl of congee.

00:28:10.759 --> 00:28:11.599
Jing'er?

00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:13.119
Dad, what's wrong?

00:28:13.119 --> 00:28:15.039
Old problem, it's fine.

00:28:15.279 --> 00:28:16.920
I'm helping my mom take care of him for a few days.

00:28:16.920 --> 00:28:18.720
Wait, should I come over to check?

00:28:19.000 --> 00:28:20.000
Don't bother.

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:21.519
Aren't you swamped with things at the restaurant?

00:28:21.519 --> 00:28:22.759
I'll be back in a couple of days.

00:28:24.000 --> 00:28:26.039
Okay, then give my regards to Mom and Dad.

00:28:26.240 --> 00:28:28.640
Let me know if anything comes up.

00:28:35.720 --> 00:28:38.480
Dad, did Mom wash those new insoles for me?

00:28:38.480 --> 00:28:39.200
Have you seen them?

00:28:41.039 --> 00:28:42.759
Are they on the shoe rack?

00:28:43.119 --> 00:28:44.000
I looked, they're not there.

00:28:46.319 --> 00:28:47.799
Call your mom and ask.

00:28:48.160 --> 00:28:49.839
You didn't get the chopsticks.

00:28:52.400 --> 00:28:53.240
Hold on a sec.

00:29:06.079 --> 00:29:06.720
Boss.

00:29:07.039 --> 00:29:08.720
We're getting ready for customers.

00:29:11.599 --> 00:29:14.240
Bro, it's almost time for customers to arrive.

00:29:14.240 --> 00:29:15.720
Why isn't Sister Jing here yet?

00:29:15.720 --> 00:29:16.720
What are we supposed to do?

00:29:16.720 --> 00:29:19.200
No, your sister-in-law has some family matters.

00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:20.200
She went back to take care of it.

00:29:20.200 --> 00:29:22.599
Isn't the restaurant just these few things?

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:24.960
Sister Jing usually handles everything.

00:29:24.960 --> 00:29:26.920
Without her, we have no backbone.

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:28.720
Am I not here?

00:29:28.960 --> 00:29:29.720
Go on, get busy.

00:29:29.960 --> 00:29:30.559
Alright.

00:29:30.839 --> 00:29:32.440
Let's all pick up the pace then.

00:29:37.480 --> 00:29:38.160
Big Brother.

00:29:38.759 --> 00:29:39.720
What's up?

00:29:40.200 --> 00:29:41.240
What's wrong?

00:29:41.240 --> 00:29:43.359
No, you sit down here first.

00:29:45.960 --> 00:29:47.039
It's nothing, nothing.

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:48.599
What's wrong? What's wrong?

00:29:48.799 --> 00:29:49.680
It's nothing, nothing, nothing.

00:29:49.680 --> 00:29:50.480
It's fine, it's fine.

00:29:50.480 --> 00:29:51.400
I accidentally broke it.

00:29:51.400 --> 00:29:52.440
I'll clean it up, it'll be fine.

00:29:52.720 --> 00:29:54.119
You scared me!

00:29:55.200 --> 00:29:56.200
Qiu'er, what's wrong?

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:58.920
Weiguo, that financial product of yours...

00:29:58.920 --> 00:30:00.319
When do you estimate you'll buy it?

00:30:00.720 --> 00:30:02.200
There are still some procedures being processed.

00:30:02.200 --> 00:30:03.119
Soon, very soon.

00:30:03.440 --> 00:30:04.920
I haven't even become Assistant Branch Manager yet,

00:30:04.920 --> 00:30:05.680
and I already have a ton of tasks.

00:30:05.680 --> 00:30:06.680
I'm not trying to pressure you.

00:30:06.680 --> 00:30:08.039
When it's convenient, let's just...

00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:09.480
be a bit more swift.

00:30:10.720 --> 00:30:11.559
Okay, I got it.

00:30:14.720 --> 00:30:17.200
Lao Tong, the boss is looking for you again.

00:30:19.440 --> 00:30:20.720
The boss is looking for me again?

00:30:27.480 --> 00:30:28.160
Liu Xing

00:30:28.160 --> 00:30:30.519
Quick, quick, quick, have a seat.

00:30:33.640 --> 00:30:36.160
Although your approval isn't official yet,

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:37.640
based on past practice,

00:30:37.640 --> 00:30:39.759
this is a done deal.

00:30:40.799 --> 00:30:42.920
So we need to get to work right now.

00:30:43.400 --> 00:30:44.519
This is the bank's newly set

00:30:44.519 --> 00:30:45.640
key performance indicators for next quarter.

00:30:45.640 --> 00:30:46.880
Here, take a look.

00:30:59.359 --> 00:31:02.480
How... how did it jump so much all at once?

00:31:02.640 --> 00:31:04.759
Doing business is like rowing upstream.

00:31:04.799 --> 00:31:06.279
If you don't advance, you fall behind.

00:31:07.839 --> 00:31:08.359
We...

00:31:08.640 --> 00:31:11.240
We didn't even meet last month's target.

00:31:12.119 --> 00:31:13.839
That's exactly why we're bringing you up.

00:31:14.359 --> 00:31:16.880
Otherwise, I'd just keep Xiao Jia, wouldn't I?

00:31:17.920 --> 00:31:19.720
You really should have kept Xiao Jia.

00:31:21.400 --> 00:31:22.400
No, it's just...

00:31:22.920 --> 00:31:25.799
Everyone's already under a lot of pressure.

00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:27.359
If you go by this,

00:31:27.359 --> 00:31:29.400
I'm afraid everyone will have complaints.

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:31.920
Without pressure, a person is aimless.

00:31:32.039 --> 00:31:33.640
Pressure is also motivation.

00:31:34.160 --> 00:31:36.160
Lao Tong, you're capable.

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:37.559
Motivate the team more.

00:31:39.480 --> 00:31:42.400
You... I really think this is a bit unrealistic.

00:31:42.400 --> 00:31:43.880
Look at how much it increased.

00:31:43.880 --> 00:31:45.240
I think this... this...

00:31:45.240 --> 00:31:47.160
This can't be done.

00:31:47.920 --> 00:31:51.119
Aren't you cozying up to Director Qiu now?

00:31:53.119 --> 00:31:55.400
Just keep going down that path.

00:31:56.759 --> 00:31:58.599
That circle of close friends around her,

00:31:58.640 --> 00:32:00.400
how you won over Director Qiu,

00:32:00.519 --> 00:32:02.480
just keep doing that to win them over.

00:32:03.160 --> 00:32:04.400
You really think highly of me.

00:32:04.400 --> 00:32:05.920
Win over her circle of friends?

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.119
The whole group... it's a total wipeout.

00:32:07.119 --> 00:32:09.359
Understood, got it.

00:32:12.279 --> 00:32:13.599
And that wealthy relative of yours,

00:32:14.039 --> 00:32:15.119
hurry them along.

00:32:15.119 --> 00:32:16.799
Don't just make noise without action.

00:32:21.039 --> 00:32:23.119
If you heard what I said, then you understand.

00:32:33.400 --> 00:32:35.359
Lao Tong, why are the targets increased again?

00:32:35.359 --> 00:32:36.640
It's simply impossible to meet.

00:32:36.640 --> 00:32:37.400
Yes, yes, yes.

00:32:37.400 --> 00:32:40.200
Brother Tong, I'm just not doing it anymore.

00:32:40.400 --> 00:32:42.799
Look at me, I'm all messed up.

00:32:42.920 --> 00:32:44.039
All messed up.

00:32:44.160 --> 00:32:46.880
Brother Tong, how did you talk to the Vice President?

00:32:46.880 --> 00:32:48.640
It's clearly impossible, isn't it?

00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:50.119
Yes, yes, yes.

00:32:50.240 --> 00:32:52.160
Right, last month's performance targets,

00:32:52.160 --> 00:32:53.920
How are you talking to Brother Tong?

00:32:53.920 --> 00:32:55.640
Aren't you just adding pressure for him?

00:32:56.119 --> 00:32:57.400
Brother Tong definitely has a plan.

00:32:57.400 --> 00:32:59.480
Anyway, I haven't paid this month's rent yet.

00:32:59.480 --> 00:33:00.160
Right, right, right.

00:33:00.480 --> 00:33:02.400
No, hey, hey, everyone, don't panic.

00:33:02.400 --> 00:33:04.400
I... I understand all your concerns.

00:33:04.400 --> 00:33:05.680
I... I'm also trying to figure something out.

00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.039
I'm trying to figure something out too.

00:33:19.559 --> 00:33:20.680
What's going on here?

00:33:20.880 --> 00:33:22.160
I ordered the sauteed lamb in sauce.

00:33:22.160 --> 00:33:23.160
What did you bring me?

00:33:23.319 --> 00:33:24.240
Scallion lamb stir-fry.

00:33:24.240 --> 00:33:25.400
How many times have I told you?

00:33:25.400 --> 00:33:26.400
I don't eat scallions. I don't eat scallions!

00:33:26.400 --> 00:33:27.440
Why can't you remember?

00:33:27.519 --> 00:33:28.640
So sorry, sir.

00:33:28.640 --> 00:33:30.640
We must have mixed up your order.

00:33:30.640 --> 00:33:32.119
I'll change it for you right now.

00:33:32.160 --> 00:33:34.400
And I'll give you half a Peking duck on the house.

00:33:34.400 --> 00:33:35.160
How does that sound?

00:33:35.160 --> 00:33:36.240
Please, calm down.

00:33:36.240 --> 00:33:37.400
That's more like it.

00:33:37.799 --> 00:33:39.920
Alright, hurry up and change it for him. Quick.

00:33:40.359 --> 00:33:40.920
Okay.

00:33:41.400 --> 00:33:43.920
Hurry, and don't mess it up this time.

00:33:47.680 --> 00:33:48.559
Xiao Zhang.

00:33:49.599 --> 00:33:50.920
What payment?

00:33:52.400 --> 00:33:53.279
Thank you, thank you.

00:33:53.279 --> 00:33:54.519
Come again, come again!

00:33:55.519 --> 00:33:56.400
Take care.

00:33:57.160 --> 00:33:57.920
Wait, these matters...

00:33:57.920 --> 00:33:59.279
Doesn't your sister-in-law usually

00:33:59.279 --> 00:34:00.559
handle the contact for those?

00:34:01.240 --> 00:34:02.160
No, don't worry.

00:34:02.160 --> 00:34:03.559
We won't shortchange you.

00:34:03.559 --> 00:34:04.119
Here's what you do.

00:34:04.119 --> 00:34:05.400
Send me that invoice.

00:34:05.400 --> 00:34:06.440
I'll transfer you the money now.

00:34:06.680 --> 00:34:08.000
No problem, no problem.

00:34:08.639 --> 00:34:09.159
Alright then.

00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:11.639
Does it really take this long to settle a bill?

00:34:11.639 --> 00:34:13.119
Sorry, sorry, just a moment, please.

00:34:13.559 --> 00:34:15.039
Such a big restaurant,

00:34:15.239 --> 00:34:16.880
and you can't even issue a receipt?

00:34:16.920 --> 00:34:17.679
Let me tell you something.

00:34:17.679 --> 00:34:18.920
Don't give me excuses.

00:34:19.000 --> 00:34:20.639
If you don't give me a receipt,

00:34:20.639 --> 00:34:22.639
I'll call and report you right now.

00:34:22.920 --> 00:34:24.159
No, no, no, miss.

00:34:24.159 --> 00:34:25.119
Wh-what's going on?

00:34:25.320 --> 00:34:26.679
We're out of receipts, boss.

00:34:26.679 --> 00:34:28.400
Sister Jing usually applies for them.

00:34:28.400 --> 00:34:29.559
I don't know how.

00:34:30.639 --> 00:34:32.239
Miss, I'm so sorry.

00:34:32.239 --> 00:34:34.119
We're having a bit of a situation at the shop today.

00:34:34.159 --> 00:34:35.639
How about this?

00:34:35.639 --> 00:34:37.400
Get a piece of paper and a pen.

00:34:37.400 --> 00:34:39.239
Could you write down your company name

00:34:39.400 --> 00:34:41.440
and your mailing address for me?

00:34:41.440 --> 00:34:42.920
I'll mail it to you by express.

00:34:42.920 --> 00:34:44.320
And then, for this bill,

00:34:44.400 --> 00:34:46.679
I'll give you a twenty percent discount, okay?

00:34:46.920 --> 00:34:48.400
Quick, get her a drink.

00:34:48.400 --> 00:34:48.920
Alright.

00:34:48.920 --> 00:34:49.639
Get an expensive one.

00:34:49.639 --> 00:34:50.400
Thank you, miss.

00:34:50.400 --> 00:34:51.920
Come again, come again!

00:34:52.920 --> 00:34:53.440
Master.

00:34:53.440 --> 00:34:53.920
What's up?

00:34:53.920 --> 00:34:55.400
Why haven't we gotten paid yet?

00:34:55.639 --> 00:34:57.119
Wasn't it supposed to be yesterday?

00:34:57.400 --> 00:34:58.239
Yeah.

00:34:58.400 --> 00:35:00.679
Usually, the mistress sends it out first thing.

00:35:01.119 --> 00:35:02.320
You know my family situation.

00:35:02.320 --> 00:35:02.880
Thank you, thank you.

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:03.280
I really need the money.

00:35:03.280 --> 00:35:03.800
Sorry about this.

00:35:03.800 --> 00:35:05.280
Right, it hasn't been sent, has it?

00:35:05.400 --> 00:35:06.320
Here's what you do, I, I, I...

00:35:06.320 --> 00:35:07.920
I'll... I'll transfer it to you right now.

00:35:07.920 --> 00:35:09.000
Later, have your sister-in-law

00:35:09.000 --> 00:35:10.119
handle the formal transfer for you, okay?

00:35:10.119 --> 00:35:11.199
Thanks, Master. I'll go serve the duck now.

00:35:11.199 --> 00:35:11.599
Alright, alright.

00:35:11.599 --> 00:35:13.119
Go on, get back to work.

00:35:18.199 --> 00:35:19.239
Where's my duck?

00:35:19.239 --> 00:35:19.960
Sorry.

00:35:21.079 --> 00:35:22.559
What are you doing here causing trouble?

00:35:22.559 --> 00:35:24.199
Go back home and rest.

00:35:24.199 --> 00:35:24.679
Go on, get out of here.

00:35:24.679 --> 00:35:26.440
A bit lost without your wife around, huh?

00:35:26.440 --> 00:35:27.280
Can't handle it all, can you?

00:35:27.480 --> 00:35:29.800
It's okay. Just busy for a bit, that's all.

00:35:29.800 --> 00:35:30.760
Waiter!

00:35:30.960 --> 00:35:31.679
Coming!

00:35:31.800 --> 00:35:33.400
When's my roast duck coming?

00:35:33.400 --> 00:35:34.119
I've been waiting forever.

00:35:34.119 --> 00:35:35.880
Alright, I'll hurry them up for you.

00:35:36.280 --> 00:35:37.960
What about that customer's roast duck?

00:35:38.440 --> 00:35:39.119
What's up?

00:35:39.880 --> 00:35:41.039
Come here, let's talk.

00:35:45.719 --> 00:35:46.800
Come on, sit, sit.

00:35:56.239 --> 00:35:57.920
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:36:00.079 --> 00:36:01.199
Ma Weiguo.

00:36:01.519 --> 00:36:03.199
You're lying to us again, aren't you?

00:36:03.880 --> 00:36:06.199
When will you ever tell the truth?

00:36:07.960 --> 00:36:09.840
Brother Bao, that thing you asked me to check,

00:36:09.840 --> 00:36:11.559
about the Harvard Cancer Research Center...

00:36:11.559 --> 00:36:12.719
I've looked into it.

00:36:12.800 --> 00:36:14.280
They don't have any

00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:16.079
new technology for glioblastoma.

00:36:16.280 --> 00:36:17.280
How can that be?

00:36:17.480 --> 00:36:18.599
Are you sure you didn't make a mistake?

00:36:19.360 --> 00:36:21.280
The person I asked was Mike,

00:36:21.280 --> 00:36:22.559
Professor Zhou's assistant.

00:36:22.559 --> 00:36:23.559
This guy even said,

00:36:23.559 --> 00:36:25.719
if this new tech gets developed,

00:36:25.719 --> 00:36:27.320
next year's Nobel Prize in Medicine

00:36:27.320 --> 00:36:28.760
is a sure thing.

00:36:30.079 --> 00:36:31.039
Ma Weiguo!

00:36:33.679 --> 00:36:35.719
Ma Weiguo, get out here!

00:36:36.159 --> 00:36:36.920
Uncle.

00:36:38.360 --> 00:36:39.880
What did he do to upset you this time?

00:36:40.199 --> 00:36:42.199
This jerk lied to us again.

00:36:42.719 --> 00:36:45.360
You mean the Harvard Cancer Research Center,

00:36:45.360 --> 00:36:46.320
the new technology thing, right?

00:36:46.320 --> 00:36:48.960
What new technology? It's all fake.

00:36:50.920 --> 00:36:52.159
You knew all along?

00:36:53.760 --> 00:36:55.360
I know a fair bit about his condition.

00:36:55.360 --> 00:36:56.599
A quick check showed it was fake.

00:36:56.679 --> 00:36:58.440
Then why didn't you tell me sooner?

00:36:59.360 --> 00:37:02.000
I was afraid you'd get worried again if I told you.

00:37:02.480 --> 00:37:03.800
How can I not worry?

00:37:04.199 --> 00:37:05.679
We all care about him so much,

00:37:05.679 --> 00:37:06.360
and what does he do?

00:37:06.360 --> 00:37:07.800
Hires an actor to fool us.

00:37:07.960 --> 00:37:09.199
What was he thinking?

00:37:09.440 --> 00:37:10.519
If he has the energy for that,

00:37:10.519 --> 00:37:11.760
why doesn't he focus on getting better?

00:37:12.159 --> 00:37:14.320
I know, I thought the same way at first.

00:37:14.920 --> 00:37:16.519
But after this time,

00:37:16.719 --> 00:37:18.239
let's not worry on his behalf.

00:37:20.440 --> 00:37:21.800
There's a patient support group.

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:24.559
I learned about his situation in there.

00:37:24.760 --> 00:37:26.719
His case isn't that unusual.

00:37:26.800 --> 00:37:29.079
Some people don't want to burden their families.

00:37:29.079 --> 00:37:31.119
Some are just angry with themselves.

00:37:31.119 --> 00:37:32.840
And others just want to let things run their course

00:37:32.840 --> 00:37:34.079
until the end of their lives.

00:37:35.440 --> 00:37:38.559
I think the illness is his own.

00:37:38.960 --> 00:37:40.519
Our worrying for him is useless.

00:37:40.519 --> 00:37:42.039
It just makes everyone feel bad in the end,

00:37:42.079 --> 00:37:43.960
and puts a lot of pressure on him.

00:37:44.920 --> 00:37:46.039
So I think...

00:37:47.480 --> 00:37:49.599
I think we should respect his choice.

00:37:54.239 --> 00:37:55.199
She really

00:37:55.639 --> 00:37:56.719
said that to you?

00:37:57.039 --> 00:37:58.719
She sees things clearer than you do.

00:38:02.039 --> 00:38:03.320
I didn't want to lie to you all either.

00:38:03.599 --> 00:38:04.119
I just...

00:38:04.119 --> 00:38:04.840
Alright, alright.

00:38:05.360 --> 00:38:06.679
Don't say another word.

00:38:07.320 --> 00:38:08.760
I'll just pretend I know nothing.

00:38:09.199 --> 00:38:09.880
Lian Bao.

00:38:10.199 --> 00:38:11.480
If I were you,

00:38:11.639 --> 00:38:13.280
I'd find a way to live.

00:38:13.960 --> 00:38:15.440
Even if there's only the tiniest bit of hope,

00:38:15.440 --> 00:38:16.480
I wouldn't give up.

00:38:16.719 --> 00:38:18.679
But I'm not you.

00:38:21.320 --> 00:38:22.119
Right.

00:38:22.920 --> 00:38:24.679
No one can make decisions for someone else.

00:38:25.159 --> 00:38:26.719
Not even with good intentions.

00:38:27.960 --> 00:38:29.159
So I don't agree with you.

00:38:29.440 --> 00:38:30.639
But I respect you.

00:38:56.280 --> 00:38:57.400
Jing'er.

00:39:00.400 --> 00:39:02.719
Feifei, where's the toilet paper?

00:39:04.079 --> 00:39:05.079
Let me look.

00:39:05.079 --> 00:39:07.000
Hey, you used up the paper

00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:08.159
and didn't put in a new roll?

00:39:10.239 --> 00:39:11.679
Mom usually changes it.

00:39:11.679 --> 00:39:13.159
I don't know where it is.

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:16.480
There isn't any.

00:39:18.960 --> 00:39:19.400
Come on.

00:39:19.400 --> 00:39:21.440
Then bring me some of the tissues from outside.

00:39:22.199 --> 00:39:23.400
Tissues?

00:39:23.559 --> 00:39:24.920
The tissues are gone too.

00:39:27.599 --> 00:39:29.719
Then find me an old test paper.

00:39:32.079 --> 00:39:33.360
Why is the power out?

00:39:33.480 --> 00:39:35.079
Yeah, why's the power out?

00:39:35.400 --> 00:39:37.360
Hey, hurry up and buy some electricity with your phone.

00:39:37.679 --> 00:39:38.400
Okay.

00:39:41.360 --> 00:39:41.960
Dad.

00:39:42.239 --> 00:39:44.639
To buy electricity, you need to enter the user number.

00:39:44.639 --> 00:39:46.320
Is it ten digits or thirteen?

00:39:46.320 --> 00:39:47.159
Do you remember?

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:49.639
How would I remember? Your mom always does it.

00:39:49.639 --> 00:39:51.360
Call your mom and ask.

00:39:54.159 --> 00:39:55.760
I can't even stand up right now.

00:39:56.639 --> 00:39:58.559
Ask your mom when she's coming back.

00:40:00.159 --> 00:40:00.760
Okay.

00:40:01.719 --> 00:40:02.800
I heard you.

00:40:03.639 --> 00:40:06.400
Mom, how... how many more days are you staying out?

00:40:09.119 --> 00:40:11.360
She says she needs to stay a few more days.

00:40:14.719 --> 00:40:16.599
Get me an old test paper.

00:40:17.440 --> 00:40:18.719
My old test papers...

00:40:19.360 --> 00:40:20.920
I haven't finished checking the answers yet.

00:40:21.639 --> 00:40:22.480
Fine.

00:40:37.960 --> 00:40:38.880
Feifei.

00:40:40.159 --> 00:40:41.599
Have you seen my razor?

00:40:41.599 --> 00:40:42.559
Nope.

00:40:42.559 --> 00:40:44.079
Have you seen my headphones?

00:40:44.239 --> 00:40:45.199
Nope.

00:40:51.280 --> 00:40:52.199
Check the clothes.

00:41:10.400 --> 00:41:12.079
I was using them just yesterday.

00:41:30.760 --> 00:41:32.159
Found them!

00:41:32.159 --> 00:41:34.159
Hey, where do you think you're going?

00:41:36.760 --> 00:41:37.920
Did you find them?

00:41:38.039 --> 00:41:39.719
Not yet. I'm digging through this basket.

00:41:40.159 --> 00:41:41.559
Were they expensive, those headphones?

00:41:42.239 --> 00:41:43.119
Pretty expensive.

00:41:44.559 --> 00:41:46.360
I was listening to them yesterday.

00:41:47.920 --> 00:41:48.880
Wait, yesterday...

00:41:48.880 --> 00:41:50.199
you were wearing these pants, right?

00:41:50.400 --> 00:41:52.039
Yeah, weren't they washed?

00:41:53.880 --> 00:41:55.119
Darn it, darn it, darn it!

00:41:56.920 --> 00:41:58.239
You forgot to check the pockets!

00:41:59.079 --> 00:42:01.239
I haven't done laundry in over ten years!

00:42:07.400 --> 00:42:09.559
Try... try if they still... still work.

00:42:09.920 --> 00:42:10.400
No, no, no.

00:42:10.400 --> 00:42:11.400
This is bad, really bad.

00:42:11.400 --> 00:42:12.960
Don't turn them on yet. Don't plug them in.

00:42:12.960 --> 00:42:13.679
Uh, you know what?

00:42:13.679 --> 00:42:15.159
First, dry them with a hairdryer.

00:42:15.159 --> 00:42:15.599
Okay.

00:42:15.840 --> 00:42:16.760
Dry them first.